# Session scratch harnesses (check_session.sh, fix_session.sh, push_session.sh,
# and any later sibling). Written during the 2026-08-20/21 Cowork sessions to
# audit repo health, repair results/ provenance, and gate the push. They carry
# session-specific commentary and are not part of the paper's reproducibility
# surface, so they stay local. If a permanent health check is wanted later,
# promote a cleaned version deliberately rather than committing one by accident.
*_session.sh
# results/ is committed for now: the validation JSONs are small and every
# reported number must be traceable to a committed artifact. Revisit when
# Stage 1 rollouts start producing large outputs.
